<p>The golem self-destructs, destroying itself and generating a blast of fire in a radius of 4, doing <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>character level 1, 10, 25, 40, 50">60, 150, 300, 450, 550</acronym> fire damage.</p><p>This spell is only usable when the golem's master is dead.</p>